      "created_at": "2017-07-20T04:37:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don’t think it necessarily follows. If the score is based on current cost, the +1 cost space tiles seem like too powerful a way to increase your own score by playing on a planet you’ve already evolved up to Species.</p>\n<p>Plus, all you have to do to keep track of the original life creation cost is look at the top of the planet tile.</p>",
